    "description": "AL's Round(Number, Precision, Direction) uses '>' to round away from zero and '<' to round toward zero. For a negative value this reverses mathematical ordering: Round(-1234.56789, 0.001, '<') returns -1234.567, while direction '>' returns -1234.568.",
